---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'November 2025';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms of Service for AIGPUValue.com - please read these terms carefully before using our GPU comparison and benchmarking services."
  currentPath="/terms"
>
  <article class="terms-page">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using AIGPUValue.com ("the Site"), you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the Site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p>
          AIGPUValue.com provides GPU comparison tools, AI benchmark data, pricing information, and educational content related to graphics cards for AI workloads. Our service includes:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>GPU specification comparisons</li>
          <li>AI benchmark data (Stable Diffusion, LLM inference, etc.)</li>
          <li>Price tracking from various retailers</li>
          <li>Value analysis and recommendations</li>
          <li>Educational guides and articles</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>3. Information Accuracy</h2>
        <p>
          While we strive to provide accurate and up-to-date information, we make no guarantees about the completeness, reliability, or accuracy of the data presented on this Site.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Pricing:</strong> Prices are fetched from third-party retailers and may change without notice. Always verify current prices before making a purchase.</li>
          <li><strong>Benchmarks:</strong> Benchmark results may vary based on system configuration, drivers, and software versions. Our data represents typical performance under standard conditions.</li>
          <li><strong>Specifications:</strong> GPU specifications are sourced from manufacturers and reputable sources, but may contain errors or become outdated.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>4. Affiliate Relationships</h2>
        <p>
          AIGPUValue.com participates in affiliate marketing programs. This means:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>We may earn commissions when you purchase products through our links</li>
          <li>Affiliate relationships do not influence our recommendations or rankings</li>
          <li>You pay no additional cost when using our affiliate links</li>
          <li>We disclose affiliate relationships as required by FTC guidelines</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>5. User Conduct</h2>
        <p>You agree not to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Use automated systems to scrape or harvest data from the Site</li>
          <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to our systems</li>
          <li>Interfere with the proper functioning of the Site</li>
          <li>Use the Site for any unlawful purpose</li>
          <li>Reproduce, duplicate, or copy our content without permission</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>6. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          The content on AIGPUValue.com, including text, graphics, logos, and software, is owned by AIGPUValue.com or its content suppliers and is protected by copyright and other intellectual property laws.
        </p>
        <p>
          You may view and print content from the Site for personal, non-commercial use only. Any other use requires our prior written permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>7. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
          The Site contains links to third-party websites, including retailer sites. We are not responsible for:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>The content or accuracy of third-party sites</li>
          <li>Products or services offered by third parties</li>
          <li>Privacy practices of third-party sites</li>
          <li>Any transactions you conduct with third parties</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>8. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          THE SITE AND ITS CONTENT ARE PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED. WE DISCLAIM ALL WARRANTIES, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>MERCHANTABILITY</li>
          <li>FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE</li>
          <li>NON-INFRINGEMENT</li>
          <li>ACCURACY OR COMPLETENESS OF CONTENT</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, AIGPUVALUE.COM SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES ARISING FROM:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your use of or inability to use the Site</li>
          <li>Reliance on any information obtained from the Site</li>
          <li>Purchases made based on our recommendations</li>
          <li>Unauthorized access to your data</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>10. Indemnification</h2>
        <p>
          You agree to indemnify and hold harmless AIGPUValue.com, its owners, employees, and affiliates from any claims, damages, losses, or expenses arising from your use of the Site or violation of these Terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>11. Modifications to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting to the Site. Your continued use of the Site after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the modified Terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>12. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the United States, without regard to its conflict of law provisions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>13. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about these Terms, please contact us:
        </p>
        <p>
          Email: <a href="mailto:contact@aigpuvalue.com">contact@aigpuvalue.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .terms-page {
    padding: var(--spacing-8) 0 var(--spacing-16);
  }

  .container--narrow {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .terms-page h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-2);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .last-updated {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-8);
  }

  .terms-section {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-8);
  }

  .terms-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-4);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .terms-section p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-4);
  }

  .terms-section ul {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding-left: var(--spacing-6);
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-4);
  }

  .terms-section li {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2);
  }

  .terms-section strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .terms-section a {
    color: var(--brand-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .terms-section a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
